cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the released measurements, please cite this repository. Please also cite the original datasets (see DATA.md)."
title: "E-INV: code and measurements for testing camera-sensor (PRNU) provenance through diffusion personalization"
version: "2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-18"
abstract: "Code, prespecification log and released measurements for E-INV, a registered test of whether a camera body's PRNU fingerprint survives diffusion personalization: transfer to generated images is bounded at 0.15 % of the real-image device contrast, with replications on FLUX.1-dev, full fine-tuning, and five Kodak and five Huawei bodies."
type: software
authors:
